Samantha Greene (HR Generalist) — Background & Career

Samantha Greene is an HR Generalist based in Denver, Colorado, born October 14, 1990, with a current salary of $70,000. She joined Insurellm in 2020 as an HR Coordinator, was promoted to HR Generalist in 2021, completed an HR Leadership Development Program in 2022, and contributed to the company’s Diversity and Inclusion efforts in 2023.s.